\begin_layout Standard
Are you trying to write this driver to learn low-level SPI/PIO backplane protocols,
 or are you trying to bypass the Pico SDK to optimize memory and boot speed?
 If you'd like,
 I can provide the explicit PIO assembly script needed to handle the half-duplex SPI timing transitions.
\end_layout

